app
  ?  ?  help  on

app
  :            :          command        on
  q ctrl+c     q          quit           on
  /            /          search         on
  B            B          history        off
  a            a          actions        off
  t ctrl+p     t          find file      off
  f            f          filter         on
  s            s          sort           off
  z            z          zoom           off
  esc          esc        unzoom         off
  ctrl+x       ctrl+x     dismiss        off
  @            @          owner page     on
  n            n          back           on
  0            0          dashboard      on
  tab ]        tab        next pane      off
  shift+tab [  shift+tab  previous pane  off
  1 2 3        1/2/3      focus pane     on

Notifications
  enter     ↵  open & read    on
  o         o  open           on
  m         m  read           on
  d         d  done           on
  M         M  all read       on
  f         f  filter         on
  F         F  clear filters  off
  r ctrl+r  r  refresh        on

list
  up k      ↑/k     up         on
  down j    ↓/j     down       on
  pgup b    pgup/b  page up    on
  pgdown f  pgdn/f  page down  on
  home g    g/home  first      on
  end G     G/end   last       on
  r ctrl+r  r       retry      off
